-model","title":"试点功能或模型","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/govern-at-scale/maintain-codebase-standards","title":"维护基本代码标准","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers","title":"赋能开发人员","childPages":[{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/drive-adoption","title":"推动采用","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/copilot-app-for-teams","title":"推出 Copilot 应用","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/integrate-ai-agents","title":"集成 AI 代理","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/drive-team-agentic-adoption","title":"推动代理采用","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact","title":"推动下游影响","childPages":[{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/achieve-company-goals","title":"实现公司目标","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/increase-test-coverage","title":"提高测试覆盖率","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/accelerate-pull-requests","title":"加速处理拉取请求","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/reduce-security-debt","title":"减少安全债务","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/measure-copilot-impact","title":"Copilot 使用情况指标","childPages":[],"layout":"journey-landing"},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/measure-success","title":"衡量试用成功率","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/explore-a-codebase","title":"探索代码库","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/explore-issues-and-discussions","title":"探究议题和讨论","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/explore-pull-requests","title":"探索拉取请求","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/write-tests","title":"编写测试","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/optimize-ai-usage","title":"优化 AI 使用情况","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/optimize-chat-usage","title":"优化聊天使用情况","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/optimize-code-reviews","title":"优化代码评审","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/reduce-technical-debt","title":"减少技术债务","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/stack-ai-generated-code-in-pull-requests","title":"Stack AI 合并请求","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/review-ai-generated-code","title":"查看 AI 代码","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/vibe-coding","title":"Vibe 编码","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/copilot-cli-hooks","title":"在 Copilot CLI 中使用钩子功能","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/use-an-ai-sme","title":"使用 AI SME","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/create-an-extension","title":"创建 CLI 扩展","childPages":[]}],"sidebarLink":{"text":"All tutorials","href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials"},"layout":"bespoke-landing"},{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use","title":"负责任使用","childPages":[{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use/chat","title":"聊天","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use/inline-suggestions","title":"内联建议","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use/agents","title":"智能体","childPages":[]}]}],"layout":"discovery-landing"},"status":200,"xHost":"docs.github.com"},"articleContext":{"title":"GitHub Copilot 的模型和定价","intro":"\u003cp\u003e查看 GitHub Copilot 中可用模型的按词元定价方式以及各种计划的超额用量的参考价格。\u003c/p\u003e","effectiveDate":"","renderedPage":"\u003ch2 id=\"how-model-pricing-works\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#how-model-pricing-works\"\u003e模型定价的工作原理\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e使用 Copilot时，交互使用令牌：输入令牌（发送到模型的内容）、输出令牌（模型生成的内容）和缓存令牌（模型重用或存储上下文）。 每个令牌都基于所使用的模型定价，总价格转换为 AI credits1 AI credit = $0.01 USD。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e交互的成本取决于两个事项：模型和使用的令牌数。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如何跟踪和计费Copilot的使用情况取决于您的计划类型：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e个人计划（Copilot Free、Copilot Pro和Copilot Pro+Copilot Max）包括GitHub AI Credits按计划而异的津贴。 有关详细信息，请参阅 \u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/billing-and-usage/individuals/billing\"\u003e个人基于使用情况的计费\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCopilot Business 与 Copilot Enterprise 包含可在计费实体层面汇总的按用户 GitHub AI Credits 额度。 有关详细信息，请参阅 \u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/billing-and-usage/organizations-and-enterprises/billing\"\u003e组织和企业的基于使用情况的计费\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e当使用量超出任何Copilot计划包含的津贴时，超出的使用量将以GitHub AI Credits为单位，按照以下定价表中显示的每个令牌费率进行计费（1AI credit = $0.01 USD）。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-accent\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e注意\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e 如果你通过 iOS 或 Android 订阅或曾订阅Copilot计划，那么购买额外AI credits的选项GitHub Mobile将不可用。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"pricing-tables\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#pricing-tables\"\u003e定价表\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e所有价格均为\u003cstrong\u003e每百万词元\u003c/strong\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"openai\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#openai\"\u003eOpenAI\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-accent\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e注意\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Models with a \u003cstrong\u003eLong context\u003c/strong\u003e tier, offer extended capabilities and longer context windows. See \u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/reference/ai-models/supported-models#models-with-extended-capabilities\"\u003eGitHub Copilot中支持的 AI 模型\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGPT-5.6 Sol、GPT-5.6 Terra、GPT-6 Astra、GPT-5.6 Luna、GPT-6 Luna、GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6.1 Sol除了缓存输入成本外，还包括缓存写入成本。 早期的 OpenAI 模型没有缓存写入成本。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable aria-labelledby=\"openai\"\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e型号\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e版本状态\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e类别\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e层\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e阈值（输入令牌）\u00